  "gaps": [
    "Catalog year/term is not printed on the capture.",
    "The capture does not list the specific courses or distribution rules for the 37 Integrative General Education credits; it only links to 'About general education requirements'.",
    "The 39 elective credits have no stated restrictions (e.g., upper-level minimums) in the capture.",
    "Kirkpatrick Signature Series is required 'In addition to the major requirements' but the capture gives no courses or credit amount, and does not say whether it falls within general education or electives.",
    "Business Emphasis (18 credit hours; GCC students only; 'not included in the major') is optional/restricted and not included in the ledger; how its credits count toward the 127 total is not stated.",
    "Financial Counseling Emphasis Option (9 credit hours: BA 110, FP 401, plus a 3-credit upper-level BA, AC, or FP elective) is optional and not included; whether it consumes elective credits is not stated.",
    "No residency (must be completed at Bellevue) requirement, minimum grade, minimum GPA, or upper-division credit minimum is stated in the capture.",
    "No designated capstone course is listed for the base Finance major (BA 439 capstone appears only within the GCC Business Emphasis).",
    "The capture defers final curriculum requirements to the BRUIN 'Academic Progress' system and to admissions counselors for minimum graduation requirements.",
    "Credit unit is printed as 'credit hours'; semester system is inferred from the reference to a student's 'final semester' and is not explicitly stated as the credit system."
  ],
